{"journal_version":1,"sequence":9,"replace_from":10,"message_count":11,"messages":[{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"`ghost` exists — borderless. Good. Verified. Done.\n\nNote: buttons keep `rounded-md` and default size h-9 px-4 — so they have padding but no margins; that's fine for adjacent placement. Done, report.","content":"`ghost` is a valid borderless variant, so the edit renders as intended and verification passed.\n\n## Change\n`app/page.tsx` (rightmost column toolbar):\n- Toolbar container: kept `sticky top-0` (added `z-10`, removed `space-x-4`).\n- Removed the four bordered/padded wrapper divs (`border-r ... pr-4/px-4`) so the Mail, Trash, Reply, and Forward buttons sit directly next to each other with no margins or dividers.\n- All toolbar buttons switched from `variant=\"outline\"` (which carries `border border-input shadow-sm`) to `variant=\"ghost\"`, removing button borders.\n- Search stays right-aligned via `ml-auto`; same five toolbar options, same icons, same `p-4` / bottom-border / light-dark background treatment.\n\n## Commands run\n- `npm run verify:agent` → exit 0, `render smoke passed: HTTP 200, 27093 bytes`\n- Read-only inspection of `components/ui/button.tsx` variants to confirm `ghost` exists (borderless).\n\n## Remaining risks\n- `ghost` buttons still use the default size (`h-9 px-4`), so icons have inherent padding rather than a tighter Mac-style icon-button width; appearance is borderless and adjacent, which was the stated requirement.\n- No interactive test coverage of hover/sticky behavior beyond the render smoke check.","response_items":[{"id":"096795d7-6b1f-4eea-95cb-5ac7da769e4a","summary":[],"type":"reasoning","content":[{"text":"`ghost` exists — borderless. Good. Verified. Done.\n\nNote: buttons keep `rounded-md` and default size h-9 px-4 — so they have padding but no margins; that's fine for adjacent placement. Done, report.","type":"reasoning_text"}],"encrypted_content":"d2fb30e0-9168-4b63-b71a-31ad58efa212-0","status":"completed"},{"id":"cadc31b8-6d13-4064-9c33-35f296344115","content":[{"annotations":[],"text":"`ghost` is a valid borderless variant, so the edit renders as intended and verification passed.\n\n## Change\n`app/page.tsx` (rightmost column toolbar):\n- Toolbar container: kept `sticky top-0` (added `z-10`, removed `space-x-4`).\n- Removed the four bordered/padded wrapper divs (`border-r ... pr-4/px-4`) so the Mail, Trash, Reply, and Forward buttons sit directly next to each other with no margins or dividers.\n- All toolbar buttons switched from `variant=\"outline\"` (which carries `border border-input shadow-sm`) to `variant=\"ghost\"`, removing button borders.\n- Search stays right-aligned via `ml-auto`; same five toolbar options, same icons, same `p-4` / bottom-border / light-dark background treatment.\n\n## Commands run\n- `npm run verify:agent` → exit 0, `render smoke passed: HTTP 200, 27093 bytes`\n- Read-only inspection of `components/ui/button.tsx` variants to confirm `ghost` exists (borderless).\n\n## Remaining risks\n- `ghost` buttons still use the default size (`h-9 px-4`), so icons have inherent padding rather than a tighter Mac-style icon-button width; appearance is borderless and adjacent, which was the stated requirement.\n- No interactive test coverage of hover/sticky behavior beyond the render smoke check.","type":"output_text","logprobs":[]}],"role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message","phase":"final_answer"}],"timestamp":"2026-11-22T14:43:09.641661+00:00"}],"meta":{"snapshot_version":1,"aid":0,"role":"workflow_agent","model":"deepseek-flash","session_state":{"used_tokens":15048,"context_tokens":3813,"step_count":5,"markup_recovered":0,"recent_call_hashes":["4d9c212abc3338a9b2fa8c77613bbd58","6d04ceeb538f6cbff4339cfdcc4b5885","3c45d71dcb1acaddc13d0e86e5418077","aed88e56ecca4a30a41edb91164ee0f6"],"reads_since_last_edit":1,"has_landed_write":true,"low_yield_since_progress":0,"distinct_evidence_count":4,"scout_ledger":[{"tool":"file_read","targe